' Built-in-Math-Heavy: 500.000 SIN+COS-Calls.
' Misst die Built-in-Dispatch-Overhead. Pro Iteration: 2 Math-Calls,
' 2 Multiplikationen, 1 Akkumulation -- typisch fuer "Particle Field"
' oder Trigonometrie-Animationen.
DIM s AS FLOAT
DIM i AS INTEGER
s = 0.0
FOR i = 1 TO 500000
    s = s + SIN(i * 0.001) * COS(i * 0.0007)
NEXT
PRINT "Sum:", s
